    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-22",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Ninth Circuit Court of Appeals Judgeship and Reorganization Act of 2025&nbsp;</strong></p><p>This bill divides the U.S. Court of Appeals for the Ninth Circuit into two judicial circuits: (1) the Ninth Circuit, and (2) a new Twelfth Circuit.</p><p>The Ninth Circuit is composed of California, Guam, Hawaii, and Northern Mariana Islands. The new Twelfth Circuit is composed of Alaska, Arizona, Idaho, Montana, Nevada, Oregon, and Washington.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-07-23T18:30:59Z"
      }
    ]
